# Normalise line endings on the way into the repository.
#
# The Docker image is built on Linux. If package.json or a shell script is
# committed with CRLF, "npm run build" fails inside the image with a
# "\r: command not found" style error that has nothing to do with the code.
# Batch files are the exception: Windows needs CRLF for them to run.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# Binary assets must never be touched by the line-ending filter.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
